# Changing a Gitea issue from its page: its state, a comment, and its assignee.

gitea-actions-assign = Assign to me
gitea-actions-close = Close issue
gitea-actions-comment = Comment
gitea-actions-comment-placeholder = Add a comment…
gitea-actions-done-assigned = Assigned to you
gitea-actions-done-closed = Issue closed
gitea-actions-done-commented = Comment added
gitea-actions-done-reopened = Issue reopened
gitea-actions-reopen = Reopen issue
